<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>6.2.6: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01602</md:content-id>
    <md:title>6.2.6: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>fe917a6b-48df-4670-821c-1f23c3f07916</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<para>For questions 1 – 8, simplify each expression completely.</para>
<!--Do not edit this div tag.  It must surround the interaction block-->
<section>
  <exercise id="_797d949c-c062-47f4-b4e6-85ada2754aee" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\((5h^2)(-3h^2)\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(-15h^2\)</para><para>\(-15h^4\)</para><para>\(-15h\)</para><para>\(-15h^8\)</para></problem><solution><para>Correct! \(-15h^4\)</para><para>Try again. Revisit 6.2.1.</para><para>The correct answer is \(-15h^4\).</para></solution></exercise>
      
      <exercise id="_22618669-f4bc-4be0-92f4-6dff2a78b09b" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\((-\frac45d^2s^2)(6ds^2)\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((-\frac{24}{5}d^2s^4)\)</para><para>\((-\frac{24}{30}d^3s^4)\)</para><para>\(-\frac{24}5d^3s^4\)</para><para>\(-\frac{24}{30}d^2s^4\)</para></problem><solution><para>Correct! \(-\frac{24}5d^3s^4\)</para><para>Try again. Revisit 6.2.1.
    </para><para>The correct answer is \(-\frac{24}5d^3s^4\).
    </para></solution></exercise>
      
      <exercise id="_0861affa-ea5a-4acb-966e-88432701743a" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\((n-4)(3n+7)\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(3n^2-19n+28\)</para><para>\(3n^2-12n+28\)</para><para>\(3n^2-5n-28\)</para><para>\(3n^2+5n-28\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.2.2.</para><para>The correct answer is \(3n^2 - 5n - 28\).</para></solution></exercise>
      
      <exercise id="_866b08d7-8240-4892-b78a-1549bcca02fc" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\((3x^2+3)(7x-5)\)</para>
      </problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.2.2.</para><para>The correct answer is \(21x^3-15x^2+21x-15\).
    </para></solution></exercise>
      
      <exercise id="_6d99c7a7-fabd-4d36-806f-27f6328a41e0" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\((m-6)(2m^2-7m+8)\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(2m^3-7m^2+8m\)</para><para>\(-6m^2-42m-48\)</para><para>\(2m^3+19m^2+34m-48\)</para><para>\(2m^3-19m^2+50m-48\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.2.3.
    </para><para>The correct answer is \(2m^3-19m^2+50m-48\).
    </para></solution></exercise>
      
      <exercise id="_6d38d9c3-f8f2-40ba-9488-f3b4fed9085d" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\((c-4)(c^2+5c-9)\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(c^3+5c^2-9c\)</para><para>\(c^3+c^2-29c+36\)</para><para>\(-4c^2-20c+36\)</para><para>\(-4c^3+c^2-29c+36\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.2.3.
    </para><para>The correct answer is \(c^3+c^2-29c+36\).
    </para></solution></exercise>
      
      <exercise id="_8082a1a0-6da7-40f9-a7b3-24a712a76dec" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\((5x - 3)^2\)</para>
      </problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.2.4.
    </para><para>The correct answer is \(25x^2-30x+9\).
    </para></solution></exercise>
      
      <exercise id="c866048d-acb4-4e6b-98ee-bd95bb66069b" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\((11z + 7)(11z - 7)\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(121z^2-144z-49\)</para><para>\(121z^2-49\)</para><para>\(121z^2+144z-49\)</para><para>\(121z^2+49\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.2.4.
    </para><para>The correct answer is \(121z^2-49\).
    </para></solution></exercise>
      
      <exercise id="_5dd80329-2e0f-428e-8f8a-0e32a84d0eb0" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>For questions 9–10, use the following polynomial functions.</para><para>\(f(x) = 5x + 4v\)</para>
        <para>\(g(x) = 5x - 4v\)</para>
      <para>\(f(x) \cdot g(x)\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(25x^2+16v^2\)</para><para>\(25x^2-40xv+16v^2\)</para><para>\(25x^2+40xv+16v^2\)</para><para>\(25x^2-16v^2\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.2.5.
    </para><para>The correct answer is \(25x^2-16v^2\).
    </para></solution></exercise>
      
      <exercise id="_973dfbb1-bf56-4e2e-884b-03bcb7a37d92" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\(f(x) \cdot f(x)\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(25x^2+16v^2\)</para><para>\(25x^2-40xv+16v^2\)</para><para>\(25x^2+40xv+16v^2\)</para><para>\(25x^2-16v^2\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.2.5.
    </para><para>The correct answer is \(25x^2+40xv+16v^2\).
    </para></solution></exercise>
    </section></section>
</content>
</document>
